# Self-hosted update source, read off disk by Admin\LaraUpdaterController.
#
# Moved here from public/updates/ because serving it over the web meant the complete
# application source was downloadable by anyone who guessed the archive filename.
#
# laraupdater.json is tracked — it is what "Check for updates" compares against, so it has
# to ship. The RELEASE-*.zip archives are build artifacts (tens of MB each); build them with
# build-update.ps1 and copy them onto the server beside this file.
*.zip
!laraupdater.json
!.gitignore
